      "text": "Someone edits on a plane and lands, and the laptop has the edit, as [C1 (one-writer)] and [D1 (sqlite-only)] promise, with [Q9 (gone)] still open. The sync worker sends the edit the moment the phone sees a network, the laptop merges it, and the person never has to think about which device saw the change first, or whether any edit made in the air was lost along the way.",
